sonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"98068","synopsis":"No description","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4721377.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"98069","synopsis":"不思議な生き物ポーちゃんと暮らすようになった若葉。\n\nオカルト好きの転校生あーちゃんこと東礼子も若葉に興味を持ち、少しだけ毎日が明るくなる。\n\nしかし、それが面白くない幽霊たちは、あーちゃんを驚かせようと動き出し……？","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746055.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"98070","synopsis":"いつも若葉に嫌がらせをしているクラスメイトの雨山は、\n\nあーちゃんに「実は若葉ちゃんが好きなんでしょ？」と図星を突かれてうろたえる。\n\n追い込まれた雨山が取った行動により、事態は思わぬ方向へ転がっていき……？","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746056.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"98071","synopsis":"心霊スポット調査をするというあーちゃんに連れられて公園に来た若葉。\n\nそこに大きな生首の幽霊が現れ、興奮したあーちゃんが幽霊を怒らせてしまう。\n\nその日はポーちゃんが不在だったこともあり、大きな悲劇が起こってしまう。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746057.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"98072","synopsis":"瀕死となったあーちゃんを救うべく、ポーちゃんの不思議な能力で「あの世」へ来た若葉。\n\n絶対に生きたいと願うあーちゃんと、絶対に友達を助けたいと願う若葉。\n\nタイムリミットが迫る中、二人の願いは届くのか……？","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746059.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"98073","synopsis":"若葉は、別のクラスの同級生・結城直哉が幽霊と対峙している所を目撃する。\n\n結城は自分と同じ能力を持っているのかもしれない。\n\nそして、その苦しみをよく知っている若葉は、結城に声を掛ける。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746060.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"98074","synopsis":"話しかけても耳を傾けない結城に、どうしていいか分からず思い悩む若葉。\n\nそんな中、あーちゃんが風邪で休んだ日を狙って、クラスの女子が若葉をからかい始める。\n\nその場面を目撃した結城と雨山が思いがけない行動を取り……？","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746061.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"98075","synopsis":"ポーちゃんに触れて以来、夢の中にまでポーちゃんが現れて悩む結城。\n\nその夢の中でポーちゃんは、自分を苦しめる能力を捨てられる場所があると言うのだ。\n\nその話を聞いた若葉は、結城に思い切った提案を持ちかける。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746063.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"98076","synopsis":"結城の苦悩を解決する糸口を探すため、自宅に招き入れる若葉。\n\nしかし、ポーちゃんと対面した結城はひどく怯えた様子で近づこうとしない。\n\nそんな中、ポーちゃんが鍵となるある言葉を呟いた。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746064.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"98077","synopsis":"捨てたいと望む物を捨てられる場所「亡失の最果て」。\n\n夏休みに入った若葉達は、その場所の鍵となる絵を見にパパの師匠・爆散先生を訪れる。\n\nその先で、若葉達は大きな一歩を踏み出すことになる。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746065.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"98078","synopsis":"光の欠片が降り注ぐ不思議な世界「亡失の最果て」へやって来た若葉と結城。\n\nはぐれてしまったあーちゃんを探していると、異界の住民達に出会う。\n\nそして、若葉は彼らからポーちゃんとの運命を予言される。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746067.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"98079","synopsis":"異界の住民、鳥人間のハルとカエルのグェロロ・ゲェロから、「亡失の最果て」の仕組みを聞く若葉と結城。その事実に、二人は大きく戸惑う。\n\n一方、あーちゃんは独裁者アマナスによって大ピンチに陥っていた。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746068.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"98080","synopsis":"望む自分に生まれ変わる場所、「輪廻転生の泉」に辿り着いた若葉と結城。\n\nそこであーちゃんの声を聞き、危険な状況であることを知る。\n\nアマナスの城に捉えられたあーちゃんを救いに、二人は動き出す。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746069.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 14","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"98081","synopsis":"アマナス城へ突入した若葉達は、アマナスの手下たちと激しく衝突する。\n\nしかし、圧倒的な数の手下たちに苦戦を強いられてしまう。\n\n絶体絶命の時、ポーちゃんの力が発揮される。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4806060.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 15","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"98082","synopsis":"「転生の刻」が始まる泉の中へ脱出した若葉達は、そこでポーちゃんの過去と、自分達との関わり、全ての真実を知る。\n\nそして、若葉とポーちゃんは、何よりも大切なある「約束」を交わす。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4806061.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":20525,"malId":21325},"mapping